approved_fma_adaptation_commit=07bdd108904eeb29e2e4986e8c1aaff3c00790f2
fma_adaptation=under METAL replace color += dstColorPremul * (1. - paintAlpha) with color = $metal::fma(dstColorPremul, make_half4(1. - paintAlpha), color); retain original expression under else
