approved_coverage_adaptation_commit=a07db8d3ec50af8eb940db4af788fbbfad74b626
coverage_adaptation=draw_path.vert selects float4 COVERAGE_TYPE and preserves coverages before interpolation when ENABLE_FEATHER or METAL; both guards and comment match the existing Rust shader literal
